### ==========================================================================
### AI Learning Management System - API Tests
### ==========================================================================
### How to obtain a Clerk Bearer Token for testing:
### 1. Run `npm run dev` and open http://localhost:3000 in your browser.
### 2. Sign in or sign up.
### 3. Open your browser Developer Tools Console (F12) and run:
###    await window.Clerk.session.getToken()
### 4. Copy the resulting JWT string and paste it into @token below.
### ==========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = YOUR_CLERK_SESSION_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Health Check (Unauthenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Auth - Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Courses - List Courses (Owned & Enrolled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Courses - Create Course
# @name createCourse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Machine Learning Fundamentals",
  "description": "Introduction to Supervised and Unsupervised Learning"
}

### 5. Courses - Explore Courses (Not Owned & Not Enrolled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/explore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Courses - Get Course Details by ID
# Replace :id with a valid course ID (e.g. seed_course_ml_01 or created above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Courses - Update Course (Owner Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Course Title",
  "description": "Updated course description"
}

### 8. Courses - Enroll in Course
# Non-owner user can enroll; duplicate enrollment returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ds_01/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Courses - Delete Course (Owner Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Materials - List Materials for a Course (Owner or Enrolled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/materials/seed_course_ml_01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Materials - Download/Stream Stored File (Owner or Enrolled)
# Replace :materialId with a valid material ID (e.g. seed_mat_01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/materials/file/seed_mat_01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Materials - Upload Document (PDF / DOCX / TXT <= 50MB, Audio <= 200MB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/materials/seed_course_ml_01/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_lecture_notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Lecture 1: Introduction to Machine Learning algorithms and supervised learning models.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 13. Materials - Delete Material (Uploader or Course Owner)
# Replace :materialId with a valid material ID (e.g. seed_mat_01)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/materials/seed_mat_01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. AI - Summarize Material (Generates & caches summary)
# Replace :materialId with a READY material ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/materials/seed_mat_01/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. AI - Course PDF Chat (RAG query across materials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What are the core topics covered in this course?",
  "materialId": "seed_mat_01"
}

### 16. AI - Course AI Tutor (Interactive patient-teacher explanations)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/tutor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can you explain supervised learning step by step with an example?",
  "history": []
}

### 17. AI - Generate Quiz (3-10 questions from course or material)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/quizzes/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numQuestions": 3,
  "materialId": "seed_mat_01"
}

### 18. Quizzes - List Course Quizzes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Quizzes - Get Quiz Details (Questions without answers)
# Replace :quizId with a valid quiz ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/seed_quiz_sample_01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Quizzes - Submit Quiz Attempt
# Replace :quizId with a valid quiz ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/seed_quiz_sample_01/attempt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "0": "A",
    "1": "B",
    "2": "C"
  }
}

### 21. AI - Generate / Replace Study Plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/study-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hoursPerWeek": 10,
  "examDate": "2026-12-15",
  "goal": "Score an A in the final exam"
}

### 22. Study Plan - Get Current Study Plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/study-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. AI - Submit Assignment for Evaluation (Text or File Upload)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Machine Learning Ethics Essay",
  "text": "Machine learning ethics involves addressing biases in training data, ensuring algorithmic transparency, and protecting user privacy in automated decision-making pipelines."
}

### 24. Assignments - List User Course Assignments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/seed_course_ml_01/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. Progress - Student Analytics & Dashboard Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

